sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant Leader
    participant Follower1
    participant Follower2
    
    Client->>Leader: Send command
    Note over Leader: Append to local log
    
    Leader->>Follower1: AppendEntries (entries, prevLogIndex, prevLogTerm)
    Leader->>Follower2: AppendEntries (entries, prevLogIndex, prevLogTerm)
    
    Note over Follower1: Check consistency
    Follower1-->>Leader: AppendEntriesResponse (Success)
    
    Note over Follower2: Check consistency
    Follower2-->>Leader: AppendEntriesResponse (Success)
    
    Note over Leader: Majority reached<br/>Update commitIndex
    Note over Leader: Apply command to State Machine
    Leader-->>Client: Return result
    
    Leader->>Follower1: AppendEntries (Heartbeat with new commitIndex)
    Note over Follower1: Apply committed entries to State Machine
